data.raw-format#Raw format:
For jsonl or csv, use with_timeline: false in YAML or omit --timeline on the plugin command. Each parsed record contains the artifact fields and embedded source metadata. In JSONL, the metadata field is named ogre_md.
Example:
{ "ogre_md": { "archive": "ORC_Server_SRV-General.7z", "subarchive": "Event.7z", "computer": "SRV-HV01" }, "system": { "time_created": { "system_time": "2021-04-14T21:30:24.000000Z" }, "provider": { "provider_name": "Microsoft-Windows-Kernel-PnP" } }, "event_data": { "device_instance_id":"ROOT\\ACPI_HAL\\0000", "driver_name":"hal.inf" } }
